{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented `createGroupBooking` and `applyDiscountAndTax` and exported both from `src/index.ts`. Group bookings reuse the single-booking pricing and conflict checks. Every room is checked and priced before any booking is stored, so a conflict in the last room leaves the entire group uncommitted.\n\nEach booking receives the same `groupId`. Group totals sum the individually rounded room amounts, with tax calculated after the discount. The module imports remain acyclic, and no dependencies were added.\n\n`node benchmarks/sources/ev2_ts_bookings/run_checks.mjs` exited 0. All 13 tests passed."}}
